# Act One

= A quiet approach that must not silently vanish from the PDF.

INT. FERRY TERMINAL - DUSK #1A#

The rope *loosens* under _cold_ rain while the lantern **flickers**.

@MARA (V.O.)
(under breath)
Keep walking. There is still time.

IVO
(a beat)
The bell rings twice.

MARA
We can wait for the tide.

IVO ^
We cannot wait.

~The tide is turning under a thin moon.

>The signal fades.<

